{"id":"d54abb2daf4a1e0c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/875_Lambek–Grishin_演算_LG.md","title":"875 Lambek–Grishin 演算 LG","display":"875_Lambek–Grishin_演算_LG","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"875-Lambek–Grishin-演算-LG\">875 Lambek–Grishin 演算 LG</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为基本范畴集合。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{coprod},\\operatorname{ldiff},\\operatorname{rdiff}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{coprod},\\operatorname{ldiff},\\operatorname{rdiff}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 为这些构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{coprod},\\operatorname{ldiff},\\operatorname{rdiff}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{coprod},\\operatorname{ldiff},\\operatorname{rdiff}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Lambek-Grishin 演算在后文同时形成 Lambek 乘法残余和 Grishin 余乘法差分。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式、自由原子与替换\">2. 公式、自由原子与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiff}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiff}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiff}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiff}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiff}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiff}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiff}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiff}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{coprod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{coprod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ldiff}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiff}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ldiff}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiff}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rdiff}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiff}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rdiff}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiff}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{LG}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{LG}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{LG}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{LG}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-结构树与洞\">3. 结构树与洞</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tree}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tree}\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\\)</span> 生成。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Hole}\">\\(\\mathsf{Hole}\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{node}(H,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{node}(H,X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{node}(X,H)\">\\(\\operatorname{node}(X,H)\\)</span> 生成。填洞 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}\">\\(\\operatorname{plug}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\Box,X)=X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\Box,X)=X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{node}(H,Y),X)=\\operatorname{node}(\\operatorname{plug}(H,X),Y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{node}(H,Y),X)=\\operatorname{node}(\\operatorname{plug}(H,X),Y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{node}(Y,H),X)=\\operatorname{node}(Y,\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{node}(Y,H),X)=\\operatorname{node}(Y,\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>序列为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{X\\Rightarrow A:X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{X\\Rightarrow A:X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理\">4. 公理</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LG}}=\\{\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LG}}=\\{\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-Lambek-规则\">5. Lambek 规则</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下每个 Lambek 规则族与第 6 节每个 Grishin 规则族均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span> 的子集。</p>\n<p>约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1};Q):=((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1}),Q)\">\\((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1};Q):=((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1}),Q)\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(();Q):=((),Q)\">\\((();Q):=((),Q)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(Y\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(Y\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}=\\{((\\operatorname{node}(\\langle A\\rangle,X)\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)):X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}=\\{((\\operatorname{node}(\\langle A\\rangle,X)\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)):X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}=\\{((\\operatorname{node}(X,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)):X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}=\\{((\\operatorname{node}(X,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)):X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot a}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(\\langle A\\rangle,\\langle B\\rangle))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot a}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(\\langle A\\rangle,\\langle B\\rangle))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>残余左规则定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(X,\\langle\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\rangle))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(X,\\langle\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\rangle))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(\\langle\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)\\rangle,X))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(\\langle\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)\\rangle,X))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-Grishin-规则\">6. Grishin 规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus a}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B)\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus a}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B)\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oslash R}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B));X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiff}(A,B)):X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oslash R}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B));X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiff}(A,B)):X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\ominus R}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B));X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiff}(A,B)):X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\ominus R}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B));X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiff}(A,B)):X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Gr}}=\\{((\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B));\\operatorname{node}(Y,X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coprod}(B,A)):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Gr}}=\\{((\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B));\\operatorname{node}(Y,X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coprod}(B,A)):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义割规则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)\\Rightarrow B):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)\\Rightarrow B):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{LG}}=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot a}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus a}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oslash R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\ominus R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Gr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{LG}}=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot a}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus a}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oslash R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\ominus R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Gr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明树\">7. 证明树</h1>\n<p>本节及后续证明索引的节点集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 限定为有限序数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T=n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\},\\qquad n\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad n&gt;0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T=n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\},\\qquad n\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad n&gt;0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>所有子节点列均为有限函数，其相等取函数外延相等。带直接边、子列和标号的候选对象有固定集合界</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TreeCode}_{\\mathsf{LG}}\n=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n&gt;0}\n\\{n\\}\\times n\\times\\mathcal P(n\\times n)\n\\times(n^{&lt;\\omega})^n\\times(\\mathsf{Seq})^n,\n\\qquad n^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}n^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TreeCode}_{\\mathsf{LG}}\n=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n&gt;0}\n\\{n\\}\\times n\\times\\mathcal P(n\\times n)\n\\times(n^{&lt;\\omega})^n\\times(\\mathsf{Seq})^n,\n\\qquad n^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}n^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明仅取其中满足下文明列树条件和节点许可的对象。若原证明记法省略直接边分量，该分量由子列恢复；若把树与标号组成二元组，取上述集合的相应重组像。因此每个固定根判断的证明与证书索引都是集合。</p>\n<p>任意以有限非空集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为节点的相同规则树均可重编码：取双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:U\\to n\">\\(b:U\\to n\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r_b=b(r),\\qquad\n\\prec_b=\\{(b(u),b(v)):u\\prec v\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r_b=b(r),\\qquad\n\\prec_b=\\{(b(u),b(v)):u\\prec v\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}_b(b(u))(i)=b(\\operatorname{ch}(u)(i)),\n\\qquad\n\\ell_b(b(u))=\\ell(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ch}_b(b(u))(i)=b(\\operatorname{ch}(u)(i)),\n\\qquad\n\\ell_b(b(u))=\\ell(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>双射保持根、唯一父节点、到根路径、无环性、子列次序及全部节点标签；每个局部规则的前提列和结论逐项相同，故许可与根判断保持。反向把有限序数视为有限集合即得原形状的证明；这里改变节点编码，不改变存在证明的可导关系。</p>\n<p>有限有根有序树是四元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in T\">\\(r\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 无父节点，其余节点有唯一父节点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 无环且每个节点沿父关系有限步到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(u)\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\)</span> 无重复地有限列举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的全部直接子节点。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(X,A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(X,A)\\)</span> 是所有五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\)</span> 的集合，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span> 是上述树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(r)=X\\Rightarrow A\">\\(\\ell(r)=X\\Rightarrow A\\)</span>，并且每个节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in T\">\\(u\\in T\\)</span> 恰按子列长度满足下列两种许可之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 没有直接子节点且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LG}}\">\\(\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LG}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 是内节点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(u)=(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(u)=(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>，并且</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl((\\ell(u_0),\\ldots,\\ell(u_{n-1})),\\ell(u)\\bigr)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{LG}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl((\\ell(u_0),\\ldots,\\ell(u_{n-1})),\\ell(u)\\bigr)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{LG}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导性\">8. 可导性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{LG}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(X,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{LG}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(X,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义可导相继式集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{LG}}\n=\n\\{X\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{LG}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{LG}}\n=\n\\{X\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{LG}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明对象索引</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(Q)\n=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(X,A)\\text{ 对某个 }X,A\\text{，且 }\\ell(r)=Q\\},\n\\quad Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(Q)\n=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(X,A)\\text{ 对某个 }X,A\\text{，且 }\\ell(r)=Q\\},\n\\quad Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明证书集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(X,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(X,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(X,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LG}}(X,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该索引只重排第 7 节的有限证明树；本条目不定义类型语义、范畴模型或外延满足关系。</p>\n<p>Lambek-Grishin 演算的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{LG}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{coprod},\n\\operatorname{ldiff},\n\\operatorname{rdiff},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus a},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oslash R},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\ominus R},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Gr}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{LG}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{LG}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{coprod},\n\\operatorname{ldiff},\n\\operatorname{rdiff},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus a},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oslash R},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\ominus R},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Gr}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{LG}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{LG}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{LG}},\\mathsf{Tree},\\mathsf{Hole},\\operatorname{plug},\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus a},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oslash R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\ominus R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Gr}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{LG}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{LG}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{LG}},\\mathsf{Tree},\\mathsf{Hole},\\operatorname{plug},\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus a},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oslash R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\ominus R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Gr}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{LG}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{LG}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义 Lambek–Grishin 句法演算；不定义类型语义、范畴模型或自然语言解析算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"875-Lambek–Grishin-演算-LG","text":"875 Lambek–Grishin 演算 LG","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式、自由原子与替换","text":"2. 公式、自由原子与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-结构树与洞","text":"3. 结构树与洞","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理","text":"4. 公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-Lambek-规则","text":"5. Lambek 规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-Grishin-规则","text":"6. Grishin 规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明树","text":"7. 证明树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导性","text":"8. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{coprod},\\operatorname{ldiff},\\operatorname{rdiff}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{coprod},\\operatorname{ldiff},\\operatorname{rdiff}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiff}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiff}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{coprod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiff}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiff}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}","display":true},{"tex":"A[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cop